  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「もしもし、ママ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「うん。みんなで初日の出を拝んでから帰ろうってことになったの、いま真っ暗闇の海岸線を歩いてるわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「いい天気ね～、これなら綺麗な朝焼けが見られそうっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「うん、うん。わかってる、あすかちゃんの面倒もちゃんと見てるわよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「いつまでも『お姉ちゃん、お姉ちゃん♪』って甘えてきて困るわ～、ぎゃは……うふふ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「お昼ご飯までには、たぶん絶対に帰るから。おせち食べてから、いっしょに初詣に行きましょ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「あすかちゃんのお母さんもウチにいるんでしょ、うんうん。じゃあみんなで、家族でね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「うん。他の子も、初詣はそれぞれ行くみたい。いいのよ、お正月ぐらいは家族と一緒に過ごしたいもん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「そうそう、いま学校のお友達と一緒。男の子もいるから大丈夫よ、じゅうぶん気をつけるし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「みんなに引き留められちゃってさ～、人気者はつらいわねっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「うん、あったりまえでしょママの子だもんっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「いやいや、デートとかじゃないのよ。『男の子もいる』っていうだけで……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「あたしママみたいに泣いて暮らすだけなら絶対、恋愛も結婚もしたくないもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「ほんとよ、ママに嘘つかないわよ～。いま証明してあげる、友達に代わるわねっ♪」"
  },
